## How to run (when needed)
```bash
# On a GPU-capable host (uicgpu A100 idle, or Polaris PBS for large batches)
conda activate nougat
nougat artifacts/paper.pdf -o extraction/ --model 0.1.0-base --recompute
# Output: extraction/paper.mmd
mv extraction/paper.mmd extraction/nougat.mmd
```
Approximate cost: ~30–60 s on an A100 for a 12-page PDF; batchable with other
LUCID-100 papers for amortized GPU time.
